00:57:03.260 --> 00:57:14.900
<v Ira Glass>This American Life is distributed by Public Radio International. WBEZ management oversight for our show by our boss, Mr. Torey Malatia, who's been puzzling over the every-changing FCC rules, until he finally arrivede at this:

00:57:14.900 --> 00:57:19.240
<v Boy>Whoever the hell made up these curse words was really wrong.

00:57:19.240 --> 00:57:48.200
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.

00:57:48.200 --> 00:57:53.200
